## PHYSICAL PARKING TIMER

The new timer is separate from booking expiry.

Keep:

```text
scheduled startTime
scheduled endTime
```

for the booking's planned time.

Add:

```text
timerStartedAt
timerEndedAt
```

for the actual physical parking session.

The actual parking charge should use:

```text
